  "question": {
    "text": "The resistance of the following circuit figure between <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0038956_Question.jpg\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 164px;\" />",
